1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 43=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,799
I have so many reasons to live.

7
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:44,040
What about you?

8
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:45,799
I love eating qingtuan.

9
00:01:46,239 --> 00:01:48,560
I also love crystal duck and tofu buns.

10
00:01:48,959 --> 00:01:51,079
I love sleeping in with Mother.

11
00:01:51,519 --> 00:01:54,519
I love reading
and playing with my brother.

12
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:56,920
And I love going
to the theater with Aunt Lanxiang.

13
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:59,950
I also love going on spring outings
outside the city and flying kites.

14
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,290
I love beating a little drum
for my third younger brother.

15
00:02:02,719 --> 00:02:05,519
I love the pearl hairpin
Aunt Suhua gave me.

16
00:02:07,159 --> 00:02:09,039
I have so many reasons to live, too.

17
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:10,360
There are too many to name.

18
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,759
Yingzhi is right.

19
00:02:15,039 --> 00:02:16,800
We have so many reasons to live.

20
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:19,039
We couldn't possibly
name them all at once.

21
00:02:19,192 --> 00:02:20,280
But one thing is certain.

22
00:02:21,759 --> 00:02:23,919
We certainly don't live
just to put the jade

23
00:02:23,919 --> 00:02:26,000
in Aunt Fengxian's room.

24
00:02:33,599 --> 00:02:34,800
I was born a servant,

25
00:02:35,479 --> 00:02:36,680
into a poor family.

26
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:38,520
You lost your father and have had

27
00:02:38,616 --> 00:02:40,104
to live under someone else's roof.

28
00:02:40,159 --> 00:02:41,120
Those are all facts.

29
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,560
But no matter what others say,

30
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:44,960
as long as we know

31
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,120
what we ourselves live for,

32
00:02:47,759 --> 00:02:48,439
all those words

33
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,719
are nothing but filth.

34
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,639
I understand now.

35
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:56,460
Keep our hearts true, follow the right
path, and go far with steady steps.

36
00:02:56,479 --> 00:02:58,560
Only then can
we be worthy of Mother's love and care,

37
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,919
and worthy
of the lives we've been given.

38
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:04,599
Aunt Lanxiang,

39
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:11,039
will we be driven out?

40
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:14,439
No.

41
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,719
Old Master.

42
00:03:25,016 --> 00:03:26,968
- Great-Grandfather.
- Great-Grandfather.

43
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:32,599
Your eldest uncle once wanted
you two to take your mother's surname.

44
00:03:33,319 --> 00:03:34,520
I refused.

45
00:03:35,319 --> 00:03:37,000
Being entered into the family genealogy

46
00:03:37,319 --> 00:03:39,319
is not a decision to be made on a whim.

47
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:43,919
Now, are you both willing

48
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:47,759
to give up your father's
surname and take your mother's?

49
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,840
- We are.
- We are.

50
00:04:07,719 --> 00:04:09,120
From this day forward,

51
00:04:10,199 --> 00:04:12,400
(Lin Zhangjun)
Lin Zhangjun and Lin Zhangzhi

52
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:15,159
(Lin Zhangzhi)
are descendants of the Lin family.

53
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:20,120
As long as they commit no crimes,

54
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:22,600
no one

55
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:27,639
may drive them out of the Lin Residence.

56
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:33,399
You...

57
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:35,519
This...

58
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,839
You've lost your senses!

59
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:42,720
How could you do

60
00:04:42,730 --> 00:04:44,490
something so disgraceful
and foolish? You...

61
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,480
This is outrageous!

62
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,279
My eldest grandson's wife,

63
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:50,680
Xu,

64
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:55,240
is broad-minded and noble in character,

65
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:57,759
and worthy of great responsibility.

66
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,480
From this day forward,

67
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,839
the management of the Lin household

68
00:05:07,079 --> 00:05:08,800
is entrusted to you.

69
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:20,079
You may decide
how Cheng is to be dealt with.

70
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:46,680
Zhangzhi, get up.

71
00:05:57,079 --> 00:05:59,560
Fengxian comes from a family of scholars

72
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,208
and is well-versed in the classics.

73
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,399
Within one year,

74
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:04,312
you will remain
in your room and copy the Diamond Sutra

75
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:06,000
a thousand times for the First Madam.

76
00:06:08,279 --> 00:06:08,639
I...

77
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:16,740
(Spirit Tablet
of the Late Madam Qin of the Lin Family)

78
00:06:19,199 --> 00:06:21,079
For Aunt Lingxiao's sake,

79
00:06:21,448 --> 00:06:22,950
I won't punish you publicly today.

80
00:06:28,712 --> 00:06:30,190
Thank Lanxiang for showing her mercy.

81
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:31,959
Thank Lanxiang for showing her mercy!

82
00:06:33,199 --> 00:06:34,399
If this happens again,

83
00:06:34,904 --> 00:06:37,352
I'll have no choice but
to write to the Cheng family and ask

84
00:06:37,519 --> 00:06:39,279
how they raised their daughter.

85
00:06:43,310 --> 00:06:46,296
Thank you, Lanxiang, for your leniency.

86
00:06:47,820 --> 00:06:51,780
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

87
00:06:53,500 --> 00:06:57,340
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

88
00:06:57,700 --> 00:07:00,740
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

89
00:07:01,460 --> 00:07:03,660
♪Though all the world may fade♪

90
00:07:03,660 --> 00:07:06,580
♪Time rolls on
as countless lives rush by♪

91
00:07:08,340 --> 00:07:12,580
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

92
00:07:15,460 --> 00:07:19,220
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

93
00:07:21,220 --> 00:07:25,140
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

94
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:28,260
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

95
00:07:29,260 --> 00:07:35,140
♪While whispers
of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

96
00:07:35,740 --> 00:07:39,660
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

97
00:07:39,660 --> 00:07:42,860
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

98
00:07:42,860 --> 00:07:46,860
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

99
00:07:46,860 --> 00:07:49,460
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

100
00:07:49,460 --> 00:07:53,780
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

101
00:07:53,780 --> 00:07:56,900
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

102
00:07:57,220 --> 00:08:00,820
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

103
00:08:00,820 --> 00:08:04,740
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

104
00:08:20,460 --> 00:08:24,780
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

105
00:08:27,380 --> 00:08:31,820
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

106
00:08:33,580 --> 00:08:37,340
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

107
00:08:37,980 --> 00:08:40,660
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

108
