♪While whispers
of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

109
00:08:47,580 --> 00:08:52,020
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

110
00:08:52,020 --> 00:08:55,020
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

111
00:08:55,020 --> 00:08:59,060
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

112
00:08:59,060 --> 00:09:03,020
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

113
00:09:03,660 --> 00:09:07,980
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

114
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:11,100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

115
00:09:11,100 --> 00:09:14,940
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

116
00:09:14,940 --> 00:09:17,740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

117
00:09:17,740 --> 00:09:20,340
(Seven Years Later)

118
00:09:20,340 --> 00:09:21,860
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

119
00:09:21,860 --> 00:09:25,140
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

120
00:09:25,140 --> 00:09:29,020
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

121
00:09:29,020 --> 00:09:35,300
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

122
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,320
Xiulai, if you're ever
unsure about something,

123
00:09:41,559 --> 00:09:42,879
you can come discuss it with me.

124
00:09:43,759 --> 00:09:44,759
If I'm not around,

125
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:48,759
there are still
Suhua, Fengxian, and Qiuluo.

126
00:09:50,679 --> 00:09:52,840
Two heads are better than one.

127
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:56,320
There's always
a solution to every problem.

128
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:57,879
Don't worry, Lanxiang.

129
00:09:58,559 --> 00:09:59,799
I'll handle whatever I can.

130
00:09:59,976 --> 00:10:02,200
If there's anything I can't
or don't know how to handle,

131
00:10:02,376 --> 00:10:04,296
I'll be sure to ask all of you for help.

132
00:10:09,039 --> 00:10:10,960
Though we are one family,

133
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,360
our bonds come first.

134
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:16,600
But the nation has its laws,
and every family has its rules.

135
00:10:17,519 --> 00:10:19,679
Without rules, there can be no order.

136
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:22,200
If anyone breaks the family rules,

137
00:10:22,919 --> 00:10:24,759
I will punish them
severely without exception.

138
00:10:26,376 --> 00:10:28,080
I hope you will all bear this in mind.

139
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:31,559
A family that does good
will be blessed for generations.

140
00:10:32,159 --> 00:10:35,399
A family that does evil will
bring misfortune upon its descendants.

141
00:10:40,679 --> 00:10:41,600
- Yes.
- Yes.

142
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:44,088
- Yes, Madam.
- Yes, Madam.

143
00:10:54,270 --> 00:10:57,688
(Lin Zhangcheng, age seven)
Zhangcheng!

144
00:10:57,704 --> 00:10:59,480
(Lin Zhangrun, son
of Lin Jinqi and Xu Lanxiang, age four)

145
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,000
Zhangcheng, I want it.

146
00:11:01,279 --> 00:11:02,639
Come on. Come to me.

147
00:11:05,176 --> 00:11:06,200
Zhangcheng, slow down.

148
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,600
Come on.
Let's play with this, all right?

149
00:11:09,759 --> 00:11:11,120
Zhangcheng, slow down.

150
00:11:11,399 --> 00:11:12,000
Be careful.

151
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:12,720
I know, Father.

152
00:11:13,759 --> 00:11:15,159
Mother cried and made such a fuss,

153
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:17,799
saying that all her gray hair
was caused by me.

154
00:11:19,048 --> 00:11:20,488
Nothing she says will change my mind.

155
00:11:20,670 --> 00:11:22,136
I've made up my mind not to marry.

156
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,200
Lanxiang,
won't you try to talk her around?

157
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:28,240
Life is only a few short decades.

158
00:11:28,536 --> 00:11:31,032
What matters most is that
she's happy with her own life.

159
00:11:36,536 --> 00:11:38,040
Your mother-in-law, Old Madam Yuan,

160
00:11:38,050 --> 00:11:39,160
just couldn't let things go.

161
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,480
Don't be like her.

162
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:43,480
She insisted on taking
concubines just to have a grandson

163
00:11:43,799 --> 00:11:45,240
and even took two in succession.

164
00:11:45,832 --> 00:11:47,890
Both were chosen
after consulting a fortune-teller.

165
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:48,879
And what happened?

166
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:51,399
Two more
granddaughters were born in a row.

167
00:11:53,639 --> 00:11:56,159
Old Madam Yuan
practically worried herself to death.

168
00:11:57,879 --> 00:12:00,840
Old Madam Yuan died
after becoming gravely ill.

169
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:03,720
Right.

170
00:12:04,679 --> 00:12:05,679
She died of illness.

171
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,279
It was illness.

172
00:12:07,559 --> 00:12:08,960
Xiuwan is right.

173
00:12:10,039 --> 00:12:11,960
What is meant
to be yours will come to you.

174
00:12:12,639 --> 00:12:15,240
What is not meant
to be yours should not be forced.

175
00:12:16,904 --> 00:12:19,600
There's nothing wrong with
staying single and carefree for life.

176
00:12:22,919 --> 00:12:23,840
Let's play with this.

177
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,840
Your Lordship!

178
00:12:29,639 --> 00:12:30,320
Your Lordship!

179
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:33,159
Baogai.

180
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:38,679
What is it?

181
00:12:40,159 --> 00:12:40,799
His Majesty...

182
00:12:42,559 --> 00:12:45,279
His Majesty has passed away.

183
00:12:54,159 --> 00:12:56,080
Mother...

184
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:02,879
When did it happen?

185
00:13:04,879 --> 00:13:07,559
At three quarters past the Hour of Yin,
on the first of this month.

186
00:13:08,879 --> 00:13:10,039
Eighteen days ago.

187
00:13:12,056 --> 00:13:13,390
What about the Eldest Prince?

188
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:17,080
The new Emperor
has already ascended the throne.

189
00:13:35,639 --> 00:13:36,480
Head Butler,

190
00:13:36,799 --> 00:13:38,720
you and Baogai quickly
send people separately

191
00:13:38,799 --> 00:13:40,540
to notify
everyone else in the household.

192
00:13:40,559 --> 00:13:42,700
The entire household
will observe national mourning.

193
00:13:42,744 --> 00:13:43,630
No meat is to be eaten.

194
00:13:43,879 --> 00:13:45,120
No drinking or festivities.

195
00:13:45,919 --> 00:13:46,679
Yes.

196
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:52,200
Lanxiang,

197
00:13:52,559 --> 00:13:53,720
I must hurry back.

198
00:13:55,559 --> 00:13:55,960
All right.

199
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:04,519
Let's go.

200
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:06,320
I'll take you to change your clothes.

201
00:14:06,536 --> 00:14:07,960
Then we'll have some sweet cakes.

202
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:10,000
Go on.

203
00:14:10,399 --> 00:14:11,399
All right, Mother.

204
00:14:35,559 --> 00:14:36,679
By that reckoning,

205
00:14:36,919 --> 00:14:39,759
Fengtai and I are already family.

206
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:41,368
Your Highness, hold on a little longer.

207
00:14:41,370 --> 00:14:42,360
We're out of the city...

208
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:44,879
I'm fine. Full speed ahead.

209
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:47,960
The Crown Prince has returned!

210
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:53,679
This firearm was just
forged by the Imperial Armory.

211
00:14:53,816 --> 00:14:55,976
I grant you
special permission to carry it with you.

212
00:14:57,180 --> 00:15:01,660
♪Yet fate stains my sleeves with blood♪

213
00:15:01,980 --> 00:15:06,060
♪Raindrops fall,
one by one, into my dreams♪

214
00:15:07,660 --> 00:15:09,780
♪If they should wake me♪

215
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:12,500
♪Hardship will always remain♪

216
00:15:12,500 --> 00:15:17,980
♪Amid treacherous waters,
few make it to the end♪

217
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:22,940
♪How could a thousand words
soothe this aching heart?♪

218
00:15:22,940 --> 00:15:28,300
♪With guilt in my heart,
how could I ask to meet again?♪

219
00:15:29,940 --> 00:15:35,020
♪May I be like
a firefly awakening in the dark♪

220
00:15:37,112 --> 00:15:39,360
The late Emperor stood
by you through difficult times.

221
00:15:40,679 --> 00:15:41,919
Later, let's go together

222
00:15:42,168 --> 00:15:44,328
and burn some paper
offerings for the late Emperor

223
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,559
as a small gesture of farewell.

224
00:15:46,559 --> 00:15:50,980
♪I'd spend every dawn
and dusk to see it through♪

225
00:15:53,519 --> 00:15:57,039
I still vividly remember how we

226
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,200
rode side by side and fled Jinling.

227
00:16:02,639 --> 00:16:06,440
Now we are separated by life and death,

228
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,480
with only memories left.

229
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:18,879
Though the late Emperor loved crickets,

230
00:16:20,759 --> 00:16:22,039
he still knew when to stop.

231
00:16:23,416 --> 00:16:25,000
He could be considered a worthy ruler.

232
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:27,960
But the new Emperor...

233
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:44,799
I'll be more careful
with my words and actions from now on.

234
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:11,100
(One Year Later)

235
00:17:23,100 --> 00:17:25,180
(For Imperial Use)

236
00:17:49,500 --> 00:17:52,360
(Commander Ding, Third-Rank,
Commander of the Longjiang Garrison)

237
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,280
(For Imperial Use)

238
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:07,960
The undefeated General Blackhead

239
00:18:08,359 --> 00:18:11,759
(Attendant Eunuch Mao, Fourth-Rank)
met a brutal death at the hands

240
00:18:11,759 --> 00:18:13,200
(Attendant Eunuch
of the Directorate of Ceremonial)

241
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:14,160
of river bandits.

242
00:18:24,519 --> 00:18:27,640
The river bandits'
methods are brutal and bloody,

243
00:18:28,559 --> 00:18:30,240
and utterly appalling.

244
00:18:31,079 --> 00:18:33,480
This cannot be tolerated.

245
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:45,400
This is all because the Longjiang
Garrison is utterly incompetent

246
00:18:45,544 --> 00:18:47,576
and failed
in its duty to provide protection.

247
00:18:49,128 --> 00:18:51,590
Eunuch Wang spared
your families from collective punishment

248
00:18:51,944 --> 00:18:54,640
and granted the Longjiang Garrison
special permission to raise funds

249
00:18:54,759 --> 00:18:56,880
to compensate
for the plundered tribute goods.

250
00:18:57,279 --> 00:19:01,599
That is already
an extraordinary act of mercy.

251
00:19:02,344 --> 00:19:03,590
(Xu Guangyi, Duke Xiangguo)

252
00:19:03,599 --> 00:19:06,359
(Jinling Defense Commander, Commander)
Attendant Eunuch Mao is right.

253
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:07,000
(of the Central Military Command)

254
00:19:08,799 --> 00:19:09,599
Now,

255
00:19:10,759 --> 00:19:13,160
Commander Ding
has been killed by the river bandits,

256
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:17,480
leaving the post of Commander
of the Longjiang Garrison vacant.

257
00:19:20,060 --> 00:19:21,592
(Xu Sizi, son
of Duke Xiangguo, Fourth-Rank,)

258
00:19:21,592 --> 00:19:22,860
(Assistant Commander
of the Jinling Imperial Guard)

259
00:19:30,152 --> 00:19:31,752
Marquis Lin, Eunuch Wang holds

260
00:19:31,992 --> 00:19:34,720
the esteemed post of Chief Eunuch
of the Directorate of Ceremonial

261
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:36,520
and attends
to countless affairs each day,

262
00:19:36,536 --> 00:19:38,550
yet he has not forgotten an old friend.

263
00:19:38,760 --> 00:19:41,352
Knowing that you have been
without an official post for years,

264
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:44,350
he personally petitioned
His Majesty on your behalf

265
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:47,720
to appoint you Commander
of the Longjiang Garrison.

266
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:50,079
You must ensure that
the Longjiang Garrison

267
00:19:50,279 --> 00:19:53,599
compensates for the plundered
tribute goods as soon as possible.

268
00:19:53,928 --> 00:19:56,312
I'm grateful
for Eunuch Wang's confidence in me.

269
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:58,440
I'll do everything I can

270
00:19:58,696 --> 00:20:00,792
to raise
the compensation as soon as possible.

271
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:02,400
More importantly,

272
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:06,279
we must bring the river
bandits who plundered the tribute goods

273
00:20:06,279 --> 00:20:07,640
to justice

274
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:12,119
and avenge General Blackhead.

275
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:17,112
I will do everything
in my power to track down the killers

276
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:18,880
and ease His Majesty's burden.

277
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:25,440
Avenge General Blackhead.

278
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:39,160
Attendant Eunuch Mao is right.

279
00:20:46,820 --> 00:20:49,060
(Longjiang Pass Wharf)

280
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:52,039
Your Lord.

281
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:56,680
A Third-Rank Commander
was brutally tortured and killed.

282
00:20:57,128 --> 00:20:58,960
These river bandits
clearly have no regard

283
00:20:58,960 --> 00:21:00,880
for the laws of the imperial court.

284
00:21:00,936 --> 00:21:02,400
Their methods are clearly ruthless

285
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:03,519
and far from ordinary.

286
00:21:04,599 --> 00:21:08,119
The Longjiang Garrison lacks
military funds and equipment.

287
00:21:08,559 --> 00:21:10,240
Now its troops are demoralized.

288
00:21:10,712 --> 00:21:11,992
You're asking them to...

289
00:21:14,488 --> 00:21:16,360
You're asking them
to bankrupt themselves

290
00:21:16,370 --> 00:21:18,030
to compensate for the tribute goods,

291
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:20,400
and also to capture the river bandits.

292
00:21:20,440 --> 00:21:21,839
How could that possibly work?

293
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:29,119
I'm getting old.

294
00:21:29,359 --> 00:21:31,599
My hearing isn't what it used to be.

295
00:21:32,400 --> 00:21:33,400
Not what it used to be.

296
00:22:07,144 --> 00:22:09,832
Unfortunately, I've just
received orders from the Ministry of War

297
00:22:10,136 --> 00:22:12,712
to oversee Zhejiang's coastal
defenses against the Wo pirates.

298
00:22:13,799 --> 00:22:16,279
I'll be leaving Jinling soon

299
00:22:16,360 --> 00:22:18,152
to take up my post
on the Zhejiang coast.

300
00:22:19,799 --> 00:22:21,759
I won't be able
to lend you a hand, Fengtai.

301
00:22:24,296 --> 00:22:26,520
Investigating cases
is something I'm fairly good at.

302
00:22:27,599 --> 00:22:29,480
No matter
how good you are at investigating,

303
00:22:30,079 --> 00:22:32,039
you still need
capable men under your command.

304
00:22:32,359 --> 00:22:34,880
The compensation
for the tribute goods is no small sum.

305
00:22:35,640 --> 00:22:37,720
If the soldiers are driven into ruin,

306
00:22:38,079 --> 00:22:39,799
they're bound to harbor resentment.

307
00:22:40,599 --> 00:22:42,640
Why would they still
take orders from you?

308
00:22:45,912 --> 00:22:47,880
I've already submitted
a memorial to His Majesty

309
00:22:47,992 --> 00:22:49,350
proposing reforms to naval service.

310
00:22:49,912 --> 00:22:52,720
The conscription system would be
replaced with government-paid labor.

311
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:57,079
All military households would
share the cost according to their means.

312
00:22:57,920 --> 00:22:59,960
This way, poorer households

313
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:02,880
wouldn't be ruined
when assigned minor service duties,

314
00:23:03,200 --> 00:23:04,279
while well-off households

315
00:23:04,720 --> 00:23:06,519
could also be spared
the burden of service.

316
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:08,440
Will His Majesty approve it?

317
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:13,110
The compensation His Majesty receives

318
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:14,599
will be paid in full.

319
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:17,510
It will also prevent
the soldiers from mutinying.

320
00:23:18,472 --> 00:23:20,270
Even if His Majesty doesn't understand,

321
00:23:21,200 --> 00:23:22,240
the Grand Secretariat will.

322
00:23:22,776 --> 00:23:24,000
They will certainly approve it.

323
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:25,960
The eunuchs wield great power now.

324
00:23:28,200 --> 00:23:29,160
You must be careful.

325
00:23:35,720 --> 00:23:37,912
Our coastal defenses
are short of troops now.

326
00:23:38,599 --> 00:23:39,880
You be careful, too.

327
00:23:49,220 --> 00:23:54,540
(The Tale of Suppressing the Bandits)

328
00:24:24,860 --> 00:24:27,440
(The Tale of Suppressing
the Bandits: The General, Tanniang)

329
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:28,920
The Tale of Suppressing the Bandits?

330
00:24:30,359 --> 00:24:31,759
The general, Tanniang,

331
00:24:33,119 --> 00:24:34,240
is a woman?

332
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:35,960
Do you think, Marquis Lin,

333
00:24:36,359 --> 00:24:37,920
that women cannot be generals?

334
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:40,759
The Shang dynasty had Fu Hao.

335
00:24:40,960 --> 00:24:42,359
The Sui dynasty had Madam Xian.

336
00:24:42,600 --> 00:24:44,200
The Tang dynasty had Princess Pingyang.

337
00:24:44,720 --> 00:24:47,079
Which of them achieved
any less than male generals?

338
00:24:51,920 --> 00:24:53,599
Your husband is poorly learned,

339
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:55,640
and bound by outdated conventions.

340
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:57,319
I spoke rashly just now.

341
00:24:57,799 --> 00:24:59,400
Please forgive me, my lady.

342
00:25:01,920 --> 00:25:03,599
Don't underestimate the play I wrote.

343
00:25:03,848 --> 00:25:05,340
Even the vendors selling wooden swords

344
00:25:05,359 --> 00:25:07,079
at the Imperial Theater

345
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:09,192
have seen
their earnings rise by thirty percent.

346
00:25:09,319 --> 00:25:10,960
Zhangcheng's future shops

347
00:25:11,160 --> 00:25:13,599
and farmland will all
depend on this pen of mine.

348
00:25:14,136 --> 00:25:16,280
You really do have a knack
for running the household.

349
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:19,599
I happen to have
something I'd like your advice on.

350
00:25:23,864 --> 00:25:26,240
Over the years, the stricter
the maritime ban has become,

351
00:25:26,312 --> 00:25:28,152
the more rampant the bandits have grown.

352
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:31,519
River bandits even openly
attack and plunder government vessels.

353
00:25:32,640 --> 00:25:33,640
I understand

354
00:25:34,160 --> 00:25:37,000
that the late Emperor reduced the
troops, leaving us short of manpower.

355
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:38,790
But without reducing the troops,

356
00:25:38,840 --> 00:25:40,936
the Ministry of Revenue
couldn't afford the expense.

357
00:25:43,000 --> 00:25:45,599
If the Ministry of Revenue had
a steady stream of tax revenue,

358
00:25:46,039 --> 00:25:47,759
wouldn't it be able to support the army?

359
00:25:48,839 --> 00:25:50,039
You mean...

360
00:25:57,740 --> 00:26:00,319
(To My Dear Friend, Lv Ji'er)

361
00:26:00,319 --> 00:26:02,200
This is a letter from Ji'er.

362
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:04,119
At my request,

363
00:26:04,216 --> 00:26:06,712
she recorded Quanzhou's local
customs and people's livelihoods

364
00:26:06,720 --> 00:26:07,640
in detail.

365
00:26:12,060 --> 00:26:14,759
(Pepper: 0.24 taels per kg.
Agarwood: 1.6 taels per kg.)

366
00:26:14,760 --> 00:26:16,824
These are
the prices around Jinling and Suzhou

367
00:26:16,872 --> 00:26:19,440
that I collected for writing my plays.

368
00:26:24,420 --> 00:26:25,720
(Pepper: 0.24 taels per kg.
Agarwood: 1.6 taels per kg.)

369
00:26:25,720 --> 00:26:27,640
The profits really are substantial.

370
00:26:28,839 --> 00:26:30,400
No wonder Jinqiao was tempted.

371
00:26:31,544 --> 00:26:33,830
How did Yu the Great
succeed in controlling the floods?

372
00:26:34,599 --> 00:26:36,119
He simply followed eight words.

373
00:26:36,960 --> 00:26:40,559
Better to channel than block,
better to guide than channel.

374
00:26:42,799 --> 00:26:43,440
Exactly.

375
00:26:44,359 --> 00:26:46,599
If the imperial court
allowed maritime trade

376
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:48,880
and properly regulated and guided it,

377
00:26:49,519 --> 00:26:51,279
the people could not only earn a living,

378
00:26:52,039 --> 00:26:53,000
but the government

379
00:26:53,128 --> 00:26:55,112
would also have
a steady stream of tax revenue.

380
00:26:56,279 --> 00:26:57,119
Unfortunately,

381
00:26:57,680 --> 00:26:59,440
pirates and Wo pirates are rampant now.

382
00:27:00,039 --> 00:27:01,839
Even without the imperial maritime ban,

383
00:27:02,040 --> 00:27:03,750
maritime trade would still be difficult.

384
00:27:06,456 --> 00:27:09,112
Chengze has been transferred
to reorganize the coastal defenses.

385
00:27:09,640 --> 00:27:12,472
It's the perfect opportunity
to eliminate the pirates and Wo pirates.

386
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:16,039
I'm now Commander
of the Longjiang Garrison,

387
00:27:16,319 --> 00:27:18,279
so I can also wipe out the river bandits

388
00:27:18,328 --> 00:27:19,680
and strengthen the river defenses.

389
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:21,960
Once peace
is restored throughout the land,

390
00:27:22,952 --> 00:27:25,550
we can abolish the tribute
system and lift the maritime ban.

391
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:27,559
The cotton grown by the people

392
00:27:27,560 --> 00:27:28,790
and the cotton cloth they weave

393
00:27:28,920 --> 00:27:30,960
could then be sold
overseas in a steady stream

394
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:32,200
in exchange for silver.

395
00:27:32,599 --> 00:27:35,519
Commander of the Longjiang Garrison?

396
00:27:48,319 --> 00:27:49,920
I was appointed just today.

397
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,799
I was about to tell you,

398
00:27:53,119 --> 00:27:54,519
but then I saw the play you wrote.

399
00:27:54,536 --> 00:27:56,590
It was so beautifully
written and so captivating

400
00:27:57,119 --> 00:28:00,960
that I completely forgot.

401
00:28:08,519 --> 00:28:09,680
You brazen bandits!

402
00:28:09,759 --> 00:28:11,440
I'm standing right here!

403
00:28:11,559 --> 00:28:12,759
Surrender now,

404
00:28:12,960 --> 00:28:14,839
or you will be shown no mercy!

405
00:28:23,704 --> 00:28:25,110
Running around like a madwoman.

406
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:27,080
Is that any way
for a young lady to behave?

407
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:34,599
Are you trying to anger me to death?

408
00:28:35,799 --> 00:28:38,000
General Wang, your timing is perfect!

409
00:28:38,119 --> 00:28:40,759
We'll attack them from both sides

410
00:28:40,960 --> 00:28:44,039
and wipe out
the bandits in one fell swoop!

411
00:28:46,039 --> 00:28:48,200
Why don't
you wipe me out while you're at it?

412
00:28:48,559 --> 00:28:50,519
Are you trying to anger me to death?

413
00:28:50,839 --> 00:28:51,720
You really...

414
00:28:53,240 --> 00:28:53,640
This...

415
00:28:55,839 --> 00:28:56,200
I...

416
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:59,559
How did I ever
raise a daughter like you?

417
00:29:02,359 --> 00:29:03,640
Mother, please don't cry.

418
00:29:04,776 --> 00:29:07,768
- You're driving me to my grave!
- I'll behave like a proper young lady.

419
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:09,799
Will that do?

420
00:29:12,160 --> 00:29:12,839
You...

421
00:29:12,920 --> 00:29:13,839
Mother.

422
00:29:19,279 --> 00:29:22,079
Old Master is getting older by the day.

423
00:29:22,519 --> 00:29:24,359
One day, he'll be gone.

424
00:29:25,519 --> 00:29:28,319
Then the first and second branches
will divide the family property.

425
00:29:28,808 --> 00:29:30,790
No matter
how good Jinqi and Lanxiang are to you,

426
00:29:31,319 --> 00:29:32,880
they belong to a different branch.

427
00:29:33,319 --> 00:29:35,359
You won't be able
to rely on them in the future.

428
00:29:36,519 --> 00:29:37,759
I have you, Mother.

429
00:29:39,440 --> 00:29:41,319
Can I stay with you forever?

430
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:43,519
I'll be gone sooner or later, too.

431
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:45,519
In our branch,

432
00:29:46,319 --> 00:29:48,720
Fengxian will be in charge from then on.

433
00:29:49,359 --> 00:29:52,720
She's as petty as they come.

434
00:29:53,279 --> 00:29:54,960
If you have to depend on her,

435
00:29:55,480 --> 00:29:56,839
how could you possibly live well?

436
00:29:59,032 --> 00:30:01,110
You should find
a husband and marry while you can.

437
00:30:05,160 --> 00:30:06,839
Mother has prepared a dowry for me.

438
00:30:07,240 --> 00:30:08,480
I won't need to depend on her.

439
00:30:11,279 --> 00:30:13,000
Your dowry?

440
00:30:13,279 --> 00:30:15,680
It won't be yours until you're married.

441
00:30:16,839 --> 00:30:19,160
An unmarried
daughter cannot own property.

442
00:30:20,088 --> 00:30:22,350
When the time comes,
not a single thing in this residence

443
00:30:22,359 --> 00:30:23,799
will belong to you.

444
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:27,519
And you call me foolish?

445
00:30:29,359 --> 00:30:31,759
You're the foolish one!

446
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:48,680
I'll find a way

447
00:30:49,079 --> 00:30:50,400
to earn enough to support myself.

448
00:30:52,839 --> 00:30:55,920
What can a woman like you possibly do?

449
00:31:02,720 --> 00:31:03,720
Be a good girl

450
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:06,960
and marry
Second Master You as his second wife.

451
00:31:07,960 --> 00:31:08,920
Then at least

452
00:31:10,359 --> 00:31:12,039
you'll have someone to rely on.

453
00:31:12,380 --> 00:31:16,180
♪Yet I must still smile through it all♪

454
00:31:16,180 --> 00:31:18,740
♪Those things I can't forget♪

455
00:31:18,740 --> 00:31:22,820
♪The absurdities
I can't let go of fill every page♪

456
00:31:23,060 --> 00:31:24,860
♪Building a wall♪

457
00:31:24,860 --> 00:31:28,540
♪Trapped in the midst of time♪

458
00:31:28,540 --> 00:31:32,460
♪Drifting with the wind♪

459
00:31:32,940 --> 00:31:36,540
(Jinling Lin Family Zezhi Workshop)

460
00:31:36,540 --> 00:31:37,940
(Zezhi Workshop)

461
00:31:39,064 --> 00:31:40,792
What are you looking at? Get moving.

462
00:31:42,140 --> 00:31:45,980
(Zezhi Workshop)

463
00:32:05,336 --> 00:32:07,400
Our Zezhi Workshop's
looms and weaving techniques

464
00:32:07,464 --> 00:32:09,128
are the most advanced available today.

465
00:32:09,512 --> 00:32:11,800
I've taken care
of everything over there. Don't worry.

466
00:32:13,839 --> 00:32:15,119
This is our Xiaobu cloth,

467
00:32:15,599 --> 00:32:16,880
priced at 2 coins per bolt.

468
00:32:17,240 --> 00:32:19,519
Feihua cloth is 6 coins per bolt.

469
00:32:19,576 --> 00:32:20,790
As for waist-loom ramie cloth,

470
00:32:20,920 --> 00:32:22,759
it's 3.5 coins per bolt.

471
00:32:24,184 --> 00:32:26,240
Now take a look
at our coarse white cotton cloth.

472
00:32:26,519 --> 00:32:28,559
It's 0.94 coin for three meters.

473
00:32:28,808 --> 00:32:31,110
Fine three-shuttle cloth
is 0.9 coin for three meters.

474
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:34,160
Fine blue cotton cloth
is 1.05 coins for three meters.

475
00:32:35,640 --> 00:32:37,279
If I place a larger order,

476
00:32:38,039 --> 00:32:40,440
could you offer me
a better price, Shopkeeper Zhou?

477
00:32:41,799 --> 00:32:44,079
Of course
we offer discounts to major customers.

478
00:32:45,940 --> 00:32:48,140
(Gu Youzi, Lady Peng)

479
00:33:00,312 --> 00:33:01,496
Second Young Lady.

480
00:33:02,400 --> 00:33:03,480
Lady Peng, what is it?

481
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:06,319
The Head Shopkeeper arranged
to inspect the latest waist looms

482
00:33:06,319 --> 00:33:07,440
at Han Family Village
outside the city today.

483
00:33:07,440 --> 00:33:09,144
If we don't leave now, we'll be late.

484
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:12,119
The latest single-heddle,
double-treadle twill loom?

485
00:33:12,640 --> 00:33:13,039
Yes.

486
00:33:13,192 --> 00:33:14,390
That's right, Shopkeeper Zhou.

487
00:33:14,480 --> 00:33:17,119
How much can you produce here in a day?

488
00:33:17,519 --> 00:33:18,799
Shopkeeper Zhou is busy.

489
00:33:18,920 --> 00:33:19,839
I'll go with you.

490
00:33:19,920 --> 00:33:20,400
All right.

491
00:33:37,480 --> 00:33:38,680
There'll be no one on the road.

492
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:40,160
You can get some fresh air, too.

493
00:33:41,752 --> 00:33:44,136
I'm sorry to put
you through this, Second Young Lady.

494
00:33:45,440 --> 00:33:46,599
With the new looms,

495
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:48,400
a skilled weaver like you

496
00:33:48,480 --> 00:33:50,279
can weave
one extra bolt every three days.

497
00:33:50,279 --> 00:33:51,359
That's all money.

498
00:33:52,780 --> 00:33:55,112
If a little inconvenience
is all it takes to make money,

499
00:33:55,120 --> 00:33:56,430
I could make this trip every day.

500
00:33:56,440 --> 00:33:57,440
Even ten times a day.

501
00:34:54,952 --> 00:34:55,760
It's all my fault.

502
00:34:55,920 --> 00:34:56,840
This is all my fault.

503
00:34:57,016 --> 00:34:59,030
I was busy discussing
business with the merchants

504
00:34:59,096 --> 00:35:01,100
and let the Second Young Lady go
outside the city to inspect the looms.

505
00:35:01,110 --> 00:35:02,440
This has nothing to do with you.

506
00:35:02,728 --> 00:35:04,504
You couldn't
have known this would happen.

507
00:35:04,552 --> 00:35:07,150
How could
it have nothing to do with her?

508
00:35:08,420 --> 00:35:09,340
Your Lordship.

509
00:35:09,340 --> 00:35:12,540
(Lin Jincen, age 22.
Gan Qiuluo, Lin Jincen's wife)

510
00:35:16,519 --> 00:35:17,400
Any news?

511
00:35:18,264 --> 00:35:19,760
We've searched throughout the city.

512
00:35:22,568 --> 00:35:23,940
The city gates are already closed.

513
00:35:23,992 --> 00:35:27,064
I'll continue searching outside
the city first thing tomorrow morning.

514
00:35:28,639 --> 00:35:29,159
Mother.

515
00:35:35,360 --> 00:35:36,159
Second Madam.

516
00:35:37,440 --> 00:35:40,320
If anything at all happens to Xiuwan,

517
00:35:40,840 --> 00:35:42,559
I'll skin you alive!

518
00:35:42,960 --> 00:35:44,760
- Aunt Lingxiao!
- Aunt Lingxiao!

519
00:35:45,440 --> 00:35:46,199
Aunt Lingxiao!

520
00:35:47,920 --> 00:35:48,679
Aunt Lingxiao!

521
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:50,320
It's not Gantang's fault.

522
00:35:50,904 --> 00:35:51,920
It's all because of you!

523
00:35:51,920 --> 00:35:52,960
Mother!

524
00:35:53,480 --> 00:35:55,239
You have no sense of propriety at all!

525
00:35:56,480 --> 00:35:58,920
It's not
Madam's fault. It's all my fault.

526
00:35:59,199 --> 00:36:01,599
You kept taking Xiuwan
to hear those outrageous

527
00:36:01,599 --> 00:36:03,039
and indecent plays.

528
00:36:03,528 --> 00:36:05,630
Not only did they fill
her head with improper ideas,

529
00:36:05,640 --> 00:36:08,200
but they also made her think
all day about earning her own money

530
00:36:08,264 --> 00:36:09,440
and refusing to marry!

531
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:10,760
Aunt Lingxiao!

532
00:36:15,224 --> 00:36:16,360
Xiuwan has gone missing.

533
00:36:16,360 --> 00:36:17,599
We're all very worried.

534
00:36:18,264 --> 00:36:19,590
But she's already thirty-five.

535
00:36:19,710 --> 00:36:21,080
She's not a three-year-old child!

536
00:36:21,320 --> 00:36:22,840
What she should or shouldn't do

537
00:36:22,850 --> 00:36:24,510
is beyond even
your control as her mother.

538
00:36:24,800 --> 00:36:26,639
How can you blame
your niece-in-law for this?

539
00:36:32,719 --> 00:36:33,039
You...

540
00:36:39,199 --> 00:36:43,280
Tomorrow, Jincen and Liu Xiaochuan
will continue searching the city.

541
00:36:43,448 --> 00:36:45,544
Jinqiao and I
will search outside the city.

542
00:36:45,848 --> 00:36:47,992
We'll make sure
we give you an answer, Aunt Lingxiao.

543
00:36:48,599 --> 00:36:49,280
All right.

544
00:37:00,119 --> 00:37:02,119
My Xiuwan...

545
00:37:06,679 --> 00:37:07,719
Our ancestors taught us

546
00:37:07,832 --> 00:37:09,400
that women should be chaste and modest

547
00:37:09,480 --> 00:37:11,150
and should not show
themselves in public.

548
00:37:11,199 --> 00:37:14,079
Xiuwan followed Lanxiang
and forgot our ancestors' teachings.

549
00:37:14,216 --> 00:37:15,630
That's why this happened to her.

550
00:37:17,800 --> 00:37:19,800
It's all because of that servant Xu.

551
00:37:20,200 --> 00:37:21,550
She's reckless and presumptuous,

552
00:37:21,559 --> 00:37:22,679
with no regard for the rules!

553
00:37:22,910 --> 00:37:25,430
Mother, Fengxian, you're
both shouting at the top of your lungs.

554
00:37:25,440 --> 00:37:27,144
Do you want every servant to hear you?

555
00:37:42,280 --> 00:37:43,599
Mother has never had much sense.

556
00:37:43,704 --> 00:37:45,320
Lanxiang, please don't take it to heart.

557
00:37:50,960 --> 00:37:52,079
We'll be going now.

558
00:37:53,000 --> 00:37:54,039
Jinqi, Lanxiang.

559
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:55,880
Get some rest.

560
00:38:08,639 --> 00:38:09,920
We'll search together tomorrow.

561
00:38:14,480 --> 00:38:15,000
Baogai.

562
00:38:29,239 --> 00:38:30,920
Xiuwan picked up the loom

563
00:38:31,070 --> 00:38:33,048
and went missing
on her way back to the city.

564
00:38:33,272 --> 00:38:34,470
First thing tomorrow morning,

565
00:38:34,480 --> 00:38:36,400
Gantang and I
will go back to the workshop

566
00:38:36,679 --> 00:38:38,519
and ask the women who know Lady Peng

567
00:38:38,800 --> 00:38:40,320
to see if there are any other clues.

568
00:38:42,719 --> 00:38:45,239
You were put through a lot today.

569
00:38:47,599 --> 00:38:49,320
As long as Xiuwan comes back safely,

570
00:38:50,360 --> 00:38:51,599
I'll ask for nothing more.

571
00:40:49,960 --> 00:40:50,840
What's that sound?

572
00:40:51,128 --> 00:40:52,184
Let's go take a look.

573
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:19,960
Come on! Hurry!

574
00:41:28,159 --> 00:41:29,199
It's not a rabbit.

575
00:41:29,199 --> 00:41:30,719
Then it must be a badger.

576
00:41:44,239 --> 00:41:45,119
They escaped!

577
00:41:45,639 --> 00:41:47,199
The weavers we abducted escaped!

578
00:41:47,280 --> 00:41:48,119
Someone come!

579
00:41:48,119 --> 00:41:49,039
The weavers we abducted escaped!

580
00:41:49,039 --> 00:41:49,599
Someone come!

581
00:41:49,599 --> 00:41:50,119
Where is everyone?

582
00:41:50,119 --> 00:41:50,719
Get out here!

583
00:41:50,719 --> 00:41:51,239
Hurry!

584
00:41:51,239 --> 00:41:51,960
Search everywhere!

585
00:41:52,199 --> 00:41:52,679
Search!

586
00:41:56,079 --> 00:41:56,719
Come out!

587
00:41:56,719 --> 00:41:59,039
Fire!

588
00:41:59,920 --> 00:42:00,639
Fire!

589
00:42:07,700 --> 00:42:11,020
(Zhang Shuizai,
Leader of the Kidnappers)

590
00:42:17,199 --> 00:42:18,679
Get water and put out the fire.

591
00:42:18,719 --> 00:42:20,119
- Yes!
- Yes! Hurry!

592
00:42:33,320 --> 00:42:36,039
This isn't a safe place to linger.

593
00:42:55,020 --> 00:42:56,820
(Construction Supervisor,
Ministry of Works)

594
00:43:05,060 --> 00:43:07,460
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

595
00:43:15,380 --> 00:43:22,039
(Wanted)

596
00:43:22,039 --> 00:43:23,840
Lin Jinqi.

597
00:43:24,320 --> 00:43:26,119
Xu Lanxiang.

598
00:43:28,400 --> 00:43:30,000
It's been sixteen years.

599
00:43:33,000 --> 00:43:34,000
You don't even

600
00:43:35,639 --> 00:43:37,159
recognize me anymore?

601
00:43:55,780 --> 00:43:59,900
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

602
00:44:02,740 --> 00:44:07,260
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

603
00:44:08,540 --> 00:44:12,460
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

604
00:44:13,140 --> 00:44:15,900
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

605
00:44:16,620 --> 00:44:18,940
♪Though all the world may fade♪

606
00:44:18,940 --> 00:44:22,020
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

607
00:44:23,540 --> 00:44:27,780
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

608
00:44:30,700 --> 00:44:34,860
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

609
00:44:36,660 --> 00:44:40,220
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

610
00:44:40,220 --> 00:44:43,780
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

611
00:44:44,580 --> 00:44:50,260
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

612
00:44:50,620 --> 00:44:54,940
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

613
00:44:55,300 --> 00:44:58,260
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

614
00:44:58,260 --> 00:45:02,020
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

615
00:45:02,020 --> 00:45:04,900
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

616
00:45:04,900 --> 00:45:08,980
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

617
00:45:08,980 --> 00:45:12,340
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

618
00:45:12,340 --> 00:45:16,100
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

619
00:45:16,100 --> 00:45:20,100
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

